Persona B (The Design & Material Architect): Analyzes surface topology: brushed chamfers, light-reflection angles, guilloché engine patterns, integrated bracelet articulation, and material fusion (tantalum, ceramic, King Gold, forged carbon).
Persona C (The Cultural Scholar & Connoisseur Novice): Seeks the philosophical and sociological context of timepieces: why the quartz crisis reshuffled world economies, how aviation navigation depended on quadrant dials, and how a resin digital watch withstands ten atmospheres of pressure.

